---
import PageLayout from '../../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/daily-retry-ticket-preview.css';
import '../../../../styles/nickname.css';
---
<PageLayout title="타임머신" subtitle="지나간 데일리 스도쿠를 풀 수 있습니다">
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <div class="time-machine-page">
    <div class="time-machine-nav"><a href="/test/daily-sudoku/tickets/">데일리 스도쿠</a><span id="remainingUses">남은 횟수 2회</span></div>
    <section id="dateSelection">
      <p id="rewardStatus" class="time-machine-note">30문제 완성마다 1회 · 최대 2회</p>
      <div id="pastDates" class="time-machine-calendars"></div>
      <p class="time-machine-calendar-key">✓ 완료 · 진행 중인 문제는 ‘진행’으로 표시됩니다.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="departure" hidden>
      <h2 id="departureTitle">261009 Daily Sudoku</h2>
      <p id="departureDescription" class="time-machine-note">타임머신 1회를 사용합니다.</p>
      <button id="departButton" class="use-btn" type="button">이 날짜로 이동</button>
      <a class="time-machine-back" href="/test/daily-sudoku/time-machine/">달력으로</a>
    </section>
    <p class="time-machine-test-note">테스트 화면 · 실제 기록에는 반영되지 않습니다.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<script>import '../../../../scripts/time-machine-calendar-preview.js';</script>
